{"name": "Chosen by Odin", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/083a936e8262204a9292c0cbdd99d620.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU'VE BEEN CHOSEN, WARRIOR!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on dangerous quests across the Nine Realms to stop the cults of Ragnar\u00f6k. Team up with your friends in 1-3 player co-op, wield Godly powers, shape powerful builds through shared upgrade drafts, and slay everything that stands in your way. Explore mythological realms, crush the cultists, complete your quest, and escape as overwhelming hordes close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/bbeecaa6ac4fc3caeb60c642007b2639.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/3ead1dd74b17b74b56da4e6c4c36f660.poster.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/3ead1dd74b17b74b56da4e6c4c36f660.webm?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/3ead1dd74b17b74b56da4e6c4c36f660.mp4?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/083a936e8262204a9292c0cbdd99d620.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/a3d883eec909d7ccf7232c35db4a2105.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Dice Decide Your Team's Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fate Dice you craft and bring with you shape every run. At each blessing draft, all your team's dice roll onto the table, enhancing and leveling up a shared pool of upgrades in unique ways. Then everyone takes turns drafting blessings that fit their style and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to whatever fate throws your way, discover powerful synergies, and decide - as a team - whether to claim the perfect dice-enhanced blessing for yourself or leave it for a teammate who can make better use of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/bbeecaa6ac4fc3caeb60c642007b2639.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/604a80e0b1792d3464129c7cea902ec0.poster.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/604a80e0b1792d3464129c7cea902ec0.webm?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/604a80e0b1792d3464129c7cea902ec0.mp4?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/927826f2b5c1879654efe3e4dbb00cee.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight Together, Survive Together </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurl axes, bash through enemies with your shield, or unleash devastating spells as warriors chosen by Odin. Combine your unique builds and overcome increasingly tougher enemies together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/bbeecaa6ac4fc3caeb60c642007b2639.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/4073ed127068f80305a7ee7c8c47ff53.poster.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/4073ed127068f80305a7ee7c8c47ff53.webm?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/4073ed127068f80305a7ee7c8c47ff53.mp4?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/81f4aa1f8216e199f0d7c07945a31b37.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore. Collect. Escape.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through randomized Norse realms filled with side events, hidden rewards, and powerful bosses. Push your luck by exploring every corner for greater rewards, or focus on the main quest to extract with your resources before the realm is overrun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/bbeecaa6ac4fc3caeb60c642007b2639.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/fa45223e37d7440616d14f2d4696236f.poster.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/fa45223e37d7440616d14f2d4696236f.webm?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/fa45223e37d7440616d14f2d4696236f.mp4?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/3bc1c8dc184661a8e703b9e72c59e3fa.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Return To Valhalla</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your hard-earned resources back to Valhalla to forge powerful new dice, customize your dice bag, and permanently upgrade your stats and abilities. Then return to bigger challenges in new realms, or take on the dangerous boss quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/bbeecaa6ac4fc3caeb60c642007b2639.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/0f1cd3da62c3ef2b47b537f3e2875fc8.poster.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/0f1cd3da62c3ef2b47b537f3e2875fc8.webm?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/0f1cd3da62c3ef2b47b537f3e2875fc8.mp4?t=1787771024\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/083a936e8262204a9292c0cbdd99d620.webp?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique playable Warriors with distinct combat styles and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ blessings and 6 distinct God-given Patron Powers with multiple upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hybrid of action RPG combat and roguelite progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo offline, or up to 3 players in online co-op multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep meta-progression with soul levels, warrior upgrades, and dice crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted main quests with randomized side-events across Norse mythological realms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of dice variations to craft for endless variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic journey through Norse mythology as a warrior chosen by Odin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"775\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/extras/0e7e9381a104c4bffa1ff2213c0fd7a8.avif?t=1787771024\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hunt the cults of Ragnar\u00f6k across epic Norse realms in this 1-3 player co-op action game. Wield Godly powers, roll dice to shape mighty builds with your friends, and escape as overwhelming hordes close in. Return to Valhalla, grow stronger, and rewrite the saga.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120230/62d1580d82db0080b3e18447b035f564990879e6/header.jpg?t=1787771024", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Online Co-Op", "Action", "Hack and Slash", "Action Roguelike", "Co-op", "PvE"], "developers": "Bedtime Digital Games", "publishers": "Bedtime Digital Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1120230", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_eui0D1nPXI", "first_seen": 1787695200.0, "review_rank": 70}